30: GradePulse is an AI-powered student performance intelligence system designed for Nigerian schools. It uses a contextual bandit algorithm (LinUCB) to provide personalized content recommendations to students, triage students into performance tiers, and give teachers actionable data about their classrooms.
31: 
32: The core engine recommends the right content to the right student at the right time, adapting to each student's learning trajectory over time.
33: 
34: ### 2.2 What Makes GradePulse Different
35: 
